Description: Linter for localization files (.po, .ts)
 l10n-lint checks PO and Qt TS translation files for common errors
 such as missing format specifiers, inconsistent punctuation,
 untranslated strings, and encoding issues.
 .
 It supports both command-line and GTK graphical interfaces.
